    "title": "Trivia Puzzle Fortune Word Fun",
    "description": "From the makers of Trivia Star comes a new game with some serious WOW factor! Trivia Puzzle Fortune is the best trivia game you can download for FREE!\r\n\r\nTrivia Puzzle Fortune is a trivia game combined with a word game! Free for trivia addicts and quiz heads! Trivia Puzzle Fortune starts as an easy free trivia game and gets harder as you level up!\r\n\r\nENJOY CHALLENGING TRIVIA GAMEPLAY!\r\n- Train your brain and test your vocabulary with addicting trivia questions this free trivia game!\r\n- Spend points to select letters one at a time, 15 points for vowels, and 5 for consonants!\r\n- Show your friends your love of trivia through offline play\r\n- Train your brain with questions from 15+ categories including: general knowledge, food,  movie stars, animals, sports, music, films, travel, TV shows, brands, science, and more!\r\n- Answer the questions and win coins\r\n- Can't guess the answer? Use gems to get a hint and win the level!\r\n\r\nFEATURES:\r\n- Daily bonus coins and gems for free hints!\r\n- Just like your favorite Fortune Quiz Game Show!\r\n- Over 1000+ Levels of quiz games free!\r\n- Solve over 10,000 trivia question phrases!\r\n- Easy to play and difficulty increases as you go - the perfect brain training game!\r\n- Play free trivia games OFFLINE or ONLINE - anytime, anywhere.\r\n- For trivia games free in single player mode, download Trivia Puzzle Fortune for free quiz games Now!\r\n\r\nGet Trivia Puzzle Fortune for the best trivia game apps free for quizzes and trivia game fans now!!\r\nPlay trivia games now in Trivia Puzzle Fortune - it's so addictive!\r\n\r\nThe prizes in this free trivia game are not exchangeable for real-world money or prizes. Having an issue with these free trivia and quiz games for android? For immediate support, contact us at support@superfree.com\r\nThanks!\r\n\r\nTrivia Puzzle Fortune - FKA Fortune Phrases",
